      "paragraphs": [
        "On Saturday, Rashid eats lots of sweets and chocolate. He doesn't brush his teeth before bed.",
        "On Sunday morning, Rashid wakes up. His face hurts. \"What's the matter, Rashid?\" asks Dad. \"I have a toothache,\" says Rashid. \"It really hurts!\"",
        "Dad takes Rashid to see Dr. Mona, the dentist. First, she checks his teeth. Then she says, \"Too many sweet treats aren't good for your teeth. Brush your teeth two times a day and drink lots of water.\"",
